  "content": "<h1>攻城武器模組</h1><p><em>將中世紀戰爭帶入 Minecraft！</em></p><p>本模組新增<strong>功能完整的投石機、弩砲</strong>，未來還會加入更多攻城器械——具備真實物理效果、可自訂合成配方，以及沉浸式遊戲體驗。</p><hr><h2>與好友同樂！</h2><p>想和朋友一起遊玩嗎？試試<strong>DatHost</strong>，享受最佳效能與簡易設定！</p><h3>開始使用步驟</h3><ol>\n<li>前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252ftalhanation%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>透過我的連結使用 DatHost</strong></a>  </li>\n<li>註冊帳號。</li>\n<li>註冊完成後，選擇適合的方案  </li>\n<li>結帳時<strong>將自動套用 30% 折扣</strong>。\n<strong>重要提醒：</strong>折扣僅限透過此<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252ftalhanation%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">**我的連結**</a>訂購伺服器時生效！ </li>\n</ol><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fminecraft-server-hosting%253fref%253dtalhanation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6ec0353-37bd-4f09-a427-694da9f8c500\" alt=\"DatHost\"></a></p><hr><h2>特色功能</h2><h3>投石機</h3><ul>\n<li>發射具真實彈道與致命威力的投射物。</li>\n<li><strong>投射物類型</strong>：<ul>\n<li><strong>鵝卵石</strong> – 50 點傷害</li>\n<li><strong>碎石群</strong> – 12 顆小型岩石，每顆 20 點傷害</li>\n<li><strong>火焰罐</strong> – 擊中時點燃區域</li>\n<li><strong>爆炸罐</strong> – 類似 TNT 的範圍傷害</li></ul></li>\n<li>使用<strong>WASD 鍵</strong>控制，<strong>空白鍵</strong>裝填與發射  </li>\n<li>按住<strong>右鍵</strong>顯示彈道預覽</li>\n</ul><h3>弩砲</h3><ul>\n<li>精密武器，具<strong>特殊瞄準模式</strong>（右鍵）</li>\n<li>發射快速致命的弩箭，擁有真實彈道學</li>\n</ul><h3>攻城工作台</h3><ul>\n<li>使用專屬<strong>攻城工作台</strong>直接合成攻城武器</li>\n</ul><h3>修復系統</h3><ul>\n<li>使用<strong>鐵粒</strong>與<strong>木板材</strong>修復攻城武器</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>相容性與設定</h2><ul>\n<li>✅ 專為<strong>Minecraft Forge 1.20.1</strong>打造  </li>\n</ul><blockquote>\n  <p>推薦版本：<code>1.20.1 - 47.4.0</code></p>\n  <ul>\n  <li>✅ 可透過<code>saves/world/serverconfig/siegeweapons.toml</code>完整設定</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote><hr><h2>安裝方式</h2><ol>\n<li>安裝<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge 1.20.1</a>  </li>\n<li>將模組放入<code>mods/</code>資料夾  </li>\n<li>啟動遊戲，準備展開攻城戰！</li>\n</ol><hr><h2>回饋與問題回報</h2><p>發現錯誤或有建議嗎？<br>\n歡迎加入<a href=\"https://discord.gg/NG8vuDekTT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord</strong></a>社群！</p><hr><h2>我的其他模組</h2><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20dc335a-fdcd-4075-a317-4047c040a020\" alt=\"recruits-icon\"></a></h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>村民徵兵</strong></a>：<br>\n指揮專屬<strong>村民軍隊</strong>征戰沙場！現已加入<strong>外交與陣營系統</strong>！</p><hr><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-workers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/talhanation/wiki/assets/10392726/7b2f12d9-793a-491f-ba0a-c91bc3bf9e2c\" alt=\"workers-icon\"></a></h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-workers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>村民勞工</strong></a>：<br>\n雇用村民並讓他們<strong>為你工作</strong>！</p><hr><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsmall-ships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/talhanation/wiki/assets/10392726/1c579ef7-61a9-404a-bd37-99be59930b5b\" alt=\"smallships-icon\"></a></h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsmall-ships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>小型船隻</strong></a>：<br>\n駕駛<strong>專屬可航行船隻</strong>探索海洋！</p><hr><p><strong>備戰時刻已至。打造你的攻城武器。主宰戰場。</strong></p>",
